<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sigma started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sigma started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Interacciones brokerage said on Thursday it started coverage of Mexican food company Sigma Alimentos, S.A. de C.V. as a &quot;buy&quot; recommendations based on company's capacity to generate cash flow and an estimated increase in sales for 1997 and 1998.</p>
<p>--Analyst Isabel Rueda said in a weekly report: &quot;Sigma is a cyclical company and a leader in the cold cuts market with solid management, encouraging outlook and a high cash-flow generation capacity.&quot;</p>
<p>((--Karina Balderas, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9562))</p>
</text>
